Service integrations
--------------------

Anime4K Center searches and plays content from public services (AniLiberty,
RuTube, YouTube, VK Video, Kick, Twitch, sibnet.ru) through their public APIs
and through yt-dlp. No content is bundled or redistributed. DRM-protected
streams are never bypassed; the player reports them and suggests watching in
a browser.

